WEBVTT

00:00.640 --> 00:03.020
<b>JULY 10, A.D. 2096</b>

00:03.310 --> 00:06.770
<b>Regarding what we discussed the other day,
what do you think?</b>

00:07.230 --> 00:11.780
<b>After going over the materials
you provided us with, I've decided to accept.</b>

00:12.280 --> 00:14.740
<b>Ah, thank you very much!</b>

00:15.410 --> 00:19.240
<b>I'm only carrying out my duty
as a member of the Ten Master Clans.</b>

00:22.290 --> 00:24.250
<b>As you just heard...</b>

00:24.250 --> 00:28.750
<b>Master Makoto has promised
to shelter defecting magicians.</b>

00:29.130 --> 00:34.630
<b>For his part, Gongjin Zhou has sought
no compensation nor conditions.</b>

00:34.380 --> 00:39.510
<b>HEAD OF
THE KUKI FAMILY
MAMORU KUKI</b>

00:34.630 --> 00:39.510
<b>I believe that smuggling their tacticians
into the facility was his goal.</b>

00:39.810 --> 00:41.100
<b>I see.</b>

00:41.100 --> 00:43.350
<b>Good work, Mamoru.</b>

00:43.640 --> 00:47.190
<b>Are you sure we should just allow
this to happen, sir?</b>

00:47.190 --> 00:48.730
<b>It's fine.</b>

00:48.730 --> 00:52.820
<b>Though a few modifications
to the plan are in order.</b>

00:53.150 --> 00:58.200
<b>Those tacticians will undoubtedly retool
the parasite dolls.</b>

00:58.200 --> 01:02.370
<b>Are you not worried about possible casualties
among the magic high school students?</b>

01:02.370 --> 01:04.210
<b>Don't worry.</b>

01:04.210 --> 01:11.710
<b>The parasite dolls have been fitted with limiters
to forbid any attacks on noncombatants.</b>

01:12.000 --> 01:16.220
<b>None of the players in the competition
will come under attack.</b>

01:16.220 --> 01:20.100
<b>And those limiters won't be affected
by the tacticians, either?</b>

01:20.470 --> 01:25.430
<b>The parasites and the gynoids are linked
by a Loyalty Programming Spell.</b>

01:25.430 --> 01:29.310
<b>If they disobey an order,
their Psion supply will be cut off,</b>

01:29.310 --> 01:32.320
<b>and they'll be sealed
inside the gynoid's body.</b>

01:32.320 --> 01:34.990
<b>It's impossible to make them go berserk.</b>

01:35.280 --> 01:39.990
<b>But then, there wouldn't be anyone to make
the parasite dolls spin out of control, right?</b>

01:40.490 --> 01:42.990
<b>If they identify someone as an enemy...</b>

01:42.990 --> 01:48.000
<b>in other words, someone who's armed, that person
will be targeted by the parasite dolls for attack.</b>

01:48.710 --> 01:52.550
<b>I thought I'd have
Kazama's subordinate take them on.</b>

01:52.550 --> 01:54.630
<b>Do you think Kazama will go for that?</b>

01:55.340 --> 01:56.590
<b>Yes, he will.</b>

01:56.590 --> 02:00.430
<b>At least one person under his command will.</b>

02:01.600 --> 02:04.560
<b>If he finds out that the Nine Schools
Competition is being targeted,</b>

02:04.560 --> 02:07.100
<b>Miya's son is sure to make a move.</b>

02:07.100 --> 02:11.360
<b>Even if he knows
he'll be forced to play the fool,</b>

02:11.360 --> 02:14.530
<b>he'll have no other option
but to intervene.</b>

02:15.230 --> 02:17.440
<b>Lady Miya... You mean...</b>

02:17.440 --> 02:18.740
<b>of the Yotsubas?</b>

02:19.280 --> 02:23.280
<b>If he mobilizes, then Kazama will have
no choice but to follow suit.</b>

02:23.280 --> 02:26.830
<b>At the very least,
he'll have to give his tacit approval.</b>

02:26.830 --> 02:29.120
<b>Because no one is capable of...</b>

02:29.120 --> 02:32.000
<b>stopping him.</b>

04:02.630 --> 04:05.010
<b>JULY 13, A.D. 2096</b>

05:03.820 --> 05:07.030
<b>Brother, thank you
for your hard work again today.</b>

05:07.030 --> 05:09.240
<b>Why don't you take
a little break now?</b>

05:09.620 --> 05:12.120
<b>Thanks, Miyuki.</b>

05:12.500 --> 05:14.080
<b>Oh, um...</b>

05:14.080 --> 05:15.960
<b>You're welcome.</b>

05:17.460 --> 05:19.460
<b>You must be tired out today, too.</b>

05:20.540 --> 05:21.460
<b>Come over here.</b>

05:22.000 --> 05:23.340
<b>Yes!</b>

05:28.010 --> 05:31.100
<b>Still, the administrative committee
sure picked a crazy time...</b>

05:31.100 --> 05:33.970
<b>to change the Nine Schools
Competition lineup.</b>

05:34.480 --> 05:38.350
<b>Yes, since everything from player selection
to obtaining the equipment for each event...</b>

05:38.350 --> 05:40.610
<b>now has to be done over from scratch.</b>

05:45.400 --> 05:48.280
<b>Master Tatsuya,
you've received an email.</b>

05:48.280 --> 05:51.120
<b>Uh... And there's no sender.</b>

05:51.870 --> 05:52.990
<b>None?</b>

05:52.990 --> 05:54.370
<b>NEW MESSAGE</b>

05:53.660 --> 05:56.540
<b><i>It shouldn't be possible
to keep the sender line blank...</i></b>

05:56.540 --> 06:00.000
<b><i>under today's email system standards.</i></b>

06:00.380 --> 06:02.090
<b><i>The only person who can do
something like that...</i></b>

06:04.800 --> 06:07.220
<b><i>No, maybe it's too soon
to make assumptions.</i></b>

06:08.380 --> 06:10.220
<b>ROWER AND GUNNER
SHIELD DOWN
STEEPLECHASE CROSS-COUNTRY</b>

06:08.380 --> 06:10.220
<b>BATTLE BOARD
SPEED SHOOTING
CROWD BALL</b>

06:10.510 --> 06:11.720
<b>This is...</b>

06:12.300 --> 06:13.720
<b>Brother?</b>

06:14.010 --> 06:17.180
<b>It's an internal document
about the Nine Schools Competition.</b>

06:17.180 --> 06:21.980
<b>It states that the lineup change was made
due to pressure by the JDF.</b>

06:22.310 --> 06:23.730
<b>The JDF?</b>

06:24.110 --> 06:27.820
<b>And that's not all. The Kudou Family
has taken advantage of the JDF's move...</b>

06:27.820 --> 06:30.950
<b>to attempt to conduct
a performance test of the weapon...</b>

06:30.950 --> 06:34.620
<b>they've been secretly developing
during the Steeplechase Cross-country Event.</b>

06:35.740 --> 06:38.460
<b>Brother, what will you do?</b>

06:39.170 --> 06:40.960
<b>Let's see.</b>

06:41.330 --> 06:44.210
<b>JULY 14, A.D. 2096</b>

06:45.380 --> 06:46.210
<b>Master...</b>

06:46.710 --> 06:51.470
<b>Forgive me for bringing
such a complicated issue to you today.</b>

06:51.470 --> 06:54.970
<b>This is one risky idea
that the Kudous have come up with, huh?</b>

06:55.600 --> 06:58.310
<b>The Steeplechase Cross-country Event
is dangerous enough as is...</b>

06:58.310 --> 07:00.810
<b>but using it to test his new weapons?</b>

07:00.810 --> 07:03.730
<b>It makes me wonder if he's sane.</b>

07:04.020 --> 07:09.360
<b>Were you already aware of the fact
that the Kudous were planning this experiment?</b>

07:09.700 --> 07:13.740
<b>All I know is the code name, P-Weapon.</b>

07:16.370 --> 07:18.830
<b>I'm sure Kazama knows something, though.</b>

07:19.290 --> 07:22.170
<b>Do you mean the major's suppressing the info?</b>

07:22.460 --> 07:25.210
<b>I wouldn't call it that.</b>

07:25.210 --> 07:28.170
<b>He's not obligated to send
any information our way.</b>

07:28.460 --> 07:33.470
<b>Anyway, until we know the nature of this
experiment the Kudous are going to try out,</b>

07:33.470 --> 07:36.430
<b>we can't come up with any concrete measures.</b>

07:37.010 --> 07:39.060
<b>So, we'll have to dig deeper into it, right?</b>

07:39.430 --> 07:40.810
<b>That's right.</b>

07:40.810 --> 07:43.480
<b>You'll need to head to Nara.</b>

07:43.480 --> 07:45.440
<b>The former Ninth Institute, right?</b>

07:45.860 --> 07:49.740
<b>That's a meaningful location
for us Ancient Magic users.</b>

07:51.320 --> 07:54.820
<b>JULY 21, A.D. 2096</b>

08:01.620 --> 08:05.960
<b><i>I'm heading to the former Ninth Institute
with the master to investigate.</i></b>

08:05.960 --> 08:08.130
<b><i>I want you and Minami to stay home.</i></b>

08:10.210 --> 08:12.340
<b><i>Please take me with you!</i></b>

08:12.680 --> 08:16.550
<b><i>Since we don't know what the Kudous' agenda is,
I can't bring you along—</i></b>

08:16.550 --> 08:18.600
<b><i>Please, Brother!</i></b>

08:19.100 --> 08:23.480
<b><i>If Lady Miyuki is going,
then of course I'll be accompanying her.</i></b>

08:27.610 --> 08:29.150
<b>They all look delicious!</b>

08:29.150 --> 08:31.110
<b>I recommend the egg sandwich.</b>

08:31.740 --> 08:33.950
<b>It's quite delicious, Minami!</b>

08:34.490 --> 08:37.990
<b><i>Number 666 will be making stops at Shin Osaka...</i></b>

08:34.490 --> 08:37.990
<b>NARA STATION</b>

08:38.330 --> 08:42.330
<b><i>Shin Kobe, Shin Okayama and Shin Hiroshima.</i></b>

08:38.830 --> 08:42.330
<b>All right, I'll be heading
to the head temple in Kyoto.</b>

08:42.330 --> 08:45.000
<b>I'm leaving the Ninth Institute
investigation to you.</b>

08:45.500 --> 08:46.790
<b>Understood.</b>

08:46.790 --> 08:48.500
<b>You can count on me.</b>

08:55.220 --> 08:57.140
<b>So, Brother...</b>

08:57.140 --> 09:00.180
<b>you're not going to change your mind
about leaving me behind?</b>

09:00.560 --> 09:02.980
<b>Well, it's dangerous.
I can't take you with me.</b>

09:03.310 --> 09:05.770
<b>I promise not to get in your way!</b>

09:05.770 --> 09:08.360
<b>I want to be useful to you, Brother!</b>

09:09.440 --> 09:14.490
<b>I'm glad to hear you feel that way,
but it's too late for a young girl to be out.</b>

09:15.530 --> 09:16.660
<b>Miyuki...</b>

09:17.030 --> 09:19.410
<b>Are you an immoral young lady?</b>

09:21.290 --> 09:22.830
<b>Very well.</b>

09:22.830 --> 09:25.410
<b>I will do as you say, Brother.</b>

09:25.920 --> 09:26.960
<b>Minami...</b>

09:26.960 --> 09:28.670
<b>Look after Miyuki for me.</b>

09:29.000 --> 09:30.920
<b>Understood.</b>

09:40.510 --> 09:43.680
<b>So, that's the former Ninth Institute, huh?</b>

09:53.400 --> 09:55.190
<b><i>Female robots...</i></b>

09:55.190 --> 09:57.200
<b><i>with parasites inside them?</i></b>

10:01.530 --> 10:02.580
<b>Yes, hello?</b>

10:02.990 --> 10:03.990
<b>Yes.</b>

10:04.910 --> 10:06.910
<b>Oh, please hold on for a moment.</b>

10:07.540 --> 10:08.710
<b>Lady Miyuki...</b>

10:09.040 --> 10:13.300
<b>Mr. Mitsugu Kuroba and Lady Ayako
are waiting in the lounge.</b>

10:14.800 --> 10:17.420
<b>Please tell them I'll be right down.</b>

10:20.720 --> 10:23.430
<b>Uncle, it's been a long time.</b>

10:23.720 --> 10:24.850
<b>Right.</b>

10:24.850 --> 10:27.690
<b>I'm glad to see you looking so well, Miyuki.</b>

10:28.350 --> 10:32.310
<b>It's getting late, so I'll cut right to the chase.</b>

10:32.820 --> 10:38.200
<b>I'm here to discuss the experiment that's going to be
held during this year's Nine Schools Competition.</b>

10:38.570 --> 10:41.990
<b>The P-Weapon performance test
to be conducted...</b>

10:41.990 --> 10:44.580
<b>during the Steeplechase Cross-country Event?</b>

10:44.870 --> 10:47.620
<b>So, you knew about the P-Weapons?</b>

10:47.620 --> 10:49.960
<b>No, only their code name.</b>

10:50.250 --> 10:53.460
<b>My brother is out right now,
trying to find out what they really are.</b>

10:54.000 --> 10:55.460
<b>I see.</b>

10:57.550 --> 10:59.930
<b>Is something the matter, Uncle?</b>

10:59.930 --> 11:04.600
<b>Actually, we were just looking
into the P-Weapons ourselves.</b>

11:12.400 --> 11:16.860
<b>Here's our report on the parasite dolls,
a.k.a. P-Weapon experiment.</b>

11:17.650 --> 11:20.740
<b>Please make use of it, Big Sister Miyuki.</b>

11:21.070 --> 11:22.700
<b>Parasite dolls?</b>

11:22.700 --> 11:23.950
<b>You mean...</b>

11:23.950 --> 11:26.870
<b>I think it's exactly what you think it is.</b>

11:27.450 --> 11:31.120
<b>Parasite dolls are weapons
utilizing parasites.</b>

11:31.120 --> 11:33.630
<b>I really had to work hard
for this one.</b>

11:33.920 --> 11:39.170
<b>I was up against another Ten Master Clan,
and their security system was extremely robust.</b>

11:39.170 --> 11:43.800
<b>I don't think even Mr. Tatsuya himself
could find out everything in one night.</b>

11:46.220 --> 11:48.890
<b>You gathered all this information yourself, Ayako?</b>

11:49.310 --> 11:50.560
<b>No, no.</b>

11:50.560 --> 11:52.770
<b>It wasn't just Ayako.</b>

11:52.770 --> 11:57.360
<b>But as you know, Ayako's magic
is geared toward intelligence-gathering.</b>

11:57.360 --> 12:01.650
<b>As you're more suited for combat
and control, Miyuki, it's no surprise...</b>

12:01.650 --> 12:03.910
<b>that her specialty differs from yours.</b>

12:06.780 --> 12:08.660
<b>Sorry to summon you like this.</b>

12:09.450 --> 12:12.410
<b>We'll be leaving now.</b>

12:14.080 --> 12:17.170
<b>Please send my regards to Mr. Tatsuya.</b>

12:18.960 --> 12:22.170
<b>Thank you so much
for this valuable information.</b>

12:29.890 --> 12:33.480
<b><i>A conditional activation spell
has been applied to these gynoids.</i></b>

12:34.440 --> 12:37.650
<b><i>Is this Mental Interference-Type Magic,
Luna Strike?</i></b>

12:37.650 --> 12:41.570
<b><i>I can sense that it's not stable,
like it was added on as an afterthought.</i></b>

12:42.030 --> 12:45.660
<b><i>Luna Strike forcefully weakens
the suppression of the will...</i></b>

12:45.660 --> 12:47.830
<b><i>causing emotions to spiral out of control.</i></b>

12:48.120 --> 12:49.080
<b><i>Is this...</i></b>

12:49.450 --> 12:52.250
<b><i>a spell that can make
the parasite dolls go berserk?</i></b>

12:56.210 --> 12:57.210
<b>GET OUT OF HERE RIGHT NOW</b>

12:58.840 --> 13:00.210
<b><i>A magic attack!</i></b>

13:00.550 --> 13:02.720
<b><i>I don't have enough time to draw my CAD!</i></b>

13:12.640 --> 13:15.480
<b><i>I guess that's it for tonight's investigation.</i></b>

13:23.280 --> 13:24.990
<b>THE IRREGULAR
AT MAGIC HIGH SCHOOL
STEEPLECHASE PART II</b>

13:24.990 --> 13:28.490
<b>JULY 22, A.D. 2096</b>

13:33.000 --> 13:34.120
<b>Miyuki...</b>

13:34.120 --> 13:35.370
<b>Did something happen?</b>

13:38.920 --> 13:40.670
<b>Um, Master Tatsuya...</b>

13:40.670 --> 13:42.880
<b>It's all right, Minami.</b>

13:45.840 --> 13:47.510
<b>Last night...</b>

13:47.510 --> 13:51.140
<b>Uncle Kuroba and Ayako
brought this to the hotel.</b>

13:51.470 --> 13:53.520
<b>They came to the hotel?</b>

13:54.680 --> 13:56.350
<b>Oh, right.</b>

13:56.350 --> 13:59.400
<b>Because that hotel is run by the Yotsubas.</b>

13:59.400 --> 14:01.020
<b>Did I mess up?</b>

14:01.820 --> 14:04.150
<b>She said that it contains data
on the P-Weapons...</b>

14:04.150 --> 14:08.910
<b>the parasite dolls and a report
on the experiment in question.</b>

14:09.620 --> 14:11.240
<b>Parasite dolls...</b>

14:11.660 --> 14:13.790
<b>So, that's what those P-Weapons are?</b>

14:14.500 --> 14:17.080
<b>That's what Ayako told me.</b>

14:18.170 --> 14:23.550
<b><i>Miyuki thinks that she's hiding it,
but she feels competitive when it comes to Ayako.</i></b>

14:23.840 --> 14:26.800
<b><i>So, this is why she was depressed?</i></b>

14:27.420 --> 14:30.800
<b>Tatsuya, would you mind
showing me the contents?</b>

14:30.800 --> 14:33.640
<b>We're almost at the station, Master.</b>

14:34.180 --> 14:35.890
<b>It's all right, Brother.</b>

14:41.270 --> 14:43.400
<b>LINGYI SHU</b>

14:42.110 --> 14:43.400
<b>Ah...</b>

14:43.690 --> 14:46.400
<b>So, this was a trip worth taking, huh?</b>

14:47.240 --> 14:48.650
<b>This is...</b>

14:48.650 --> 14:53.160
<b>ZICHEN CHEN</b>

14:48.990 --> 14:53.160
<b>The magicians from the Continent
who were smuggled into the country last week.</b>

14:53.740 --> 14:57.120
<b><i>They're adept at spells for stealing control...</i></b>

14:57.120 --> 14:59.540
<b><i>of an independent information body
from another magician...</i></b>

14:59.540 --> 15:05.210
<b><i>and for removing an independent information body
from the magician's control, causing it to go berserk.</i></b>

15:06.460 --> 15:09.180
<b>The timing seems too good to be true.</b>

15:09.510 --> 15:11.550
<b>It's probably not a coincidence.</b>

15:11.550 --> 15:16.430
<b>They must've been invited by someone hoping
to use the experiment to their own advantage.</b>

15:16.430 --> 15:19.690
<b>PAUL LU</b>

15:16.770 --> 15:18.480
<b>Use the experiment?</b>

15:18.890 --> 15:22.560
<b>So, it wasn't the Kudous' idea
to invite them here?</b>

15:23.310 --> 15:24.820
<b>Oh wait, I get it.</b>

15:25.610 --> 15:29.820
<b>This is going to be
another tough one to resolve, huh?</b>

15:35.830 --> 15:40.330
<b>AUGUST 3, A.D. 2096
NINE SCHOOLS COMPETITION
PRE-EVENT PARTY HALL</b>

15:36.200 --> 15:37.040
<b>Yes!</b>

15:37.040 --> 15:38.410
<b>Thank you!</b>

15:52.180 --> 15:54.220
<b>Sorry to interrupt you.</b>

15:54.220 --> 15:57.600
<b>Are you Mr. Tatsuya Shiba of First High School?</b>

15:57.970 --> 15:59.100
<b>Yes, that's me.</b>

15:59.430 --> 16:03.230
<b>I'm Fumiya Kuroba,
a first year at Fourth High School.</b>

16:03.560 --> 16:05.520
<b>Nice to meet you, Mr. Shiba.</b>

16:05.940 --> 16:08.940
<b>Nice to meet you.
My name is Ayako Kuroba.</b>

16:08.940 --> 16:12.490
<b>Fumiya and I are twins. I'm the older sister,
and he's my younger brother.</b>

16:12.780 --> 16:13.950
<b>Nice to meet you.</b>

16:13.950 --> 16:15.370
<b>I'm Tatsuya Shiba.</b>

16:15.820 --> 16:22.120
<b>Actually, we saw your skills on display at last year's
Nine Schools Competition, and we were blown away!</b>

16:22.790 --> 16:28.420
<b>We were wondering if you wouldn't mind
teaching us how to use those skills of yours.</b>

16:28.420 --> 16:31.510
<b>That's why, though we apologize to call out to you
so suddenly, we wanted to approach you.</b>

16:32.090 --> 16:36.600
<b>It won't be possible during the Nine Schools
Competition, but I'd be glad to some other time.</b>

16:37.100 --> 16:38.560
<b>You really mean that?</b>

16:38.560 --> 16:40.020
<b>Thank you very much!</b>

16:40.020 --> 16:41.600
<b>We'll look forward to that!</b>

16:45.770 --> 16:49.570
<b><i>Who knew that they'd be the ones
to make contact first?</i></b>

16:49.570 --> 16:50.570
<b>Shiba...</b>

16:51.900 --> 16:53.610
<b>Got a minute?</b>

16:54.150 --> 16:56.410
<b>I seem to be in demand today.</b>

16:56.410 --> 16:57.370
<b>What?</b>

16:57.370 --> 16:58.370
<b>Nothing.</b>

16:58.370 --> 16:59.490
<b>What's up?</b>

17:02.870 --> 17:06.130
<b>Isn't there something strange
about this year's Nine Schools Competition?</b>

17:06.130 --> 17:07.840
<b>What do you mean, "strange"?</b>

17:07.840 --> 17:10.590
<b>The lineup change.
I can kind of understand that.</b>

17:11.090 --> 17:14.550
<b>It's a little more heavy
on combat-oriented events,</b>

17:14.550 --> 17:18.470
<b>but considering the current situation,
I think it's probably appropriate.</b>

17:18.800 --> 17:22.350
<b>But Steeplechase Cross-country
is the one exception.</b>

17:22.810 --> 17:26.600
<b>That's right. That's the only one
that's excessive. It's like an anomaly.</b>

17:26.600 --> 17:28.940
<b>There are other things about it
that don't make sense.</b>

17:28.940 --> 17:33.490
<b>All of the Nine Schools Competition events
are staged so that the audience can view them...</b>

17:32.490 --> 17:33.490
<b>ROOKIE EVENT
MONOLITH CODE QUALIFYING
(PRELIMINARY CONTEST)
EIGHTH HIGH SCHOOL
VS.
FIRST HIGH SCHOOL</b>

17:33.490 --> 17:37.030
<b>yet no one can see
anything going on during Steeplechase.</b>

17:37.360 --> 17:40.830
<b>The only explanation is that it's not meant
to be seen by the audience.</b>

17:40.830 --> 17:43.370
<b>There's another goal.</b>

17:43.950 --> 17:46.870
<b>Is that the result
of the Ichijo Family's research?</b>

17:47.170 --> 17:49.340
<b>No, I wouldn't call it that.</b>

17:49.790 --> 17:53.050
<b>If something doesn't sit right with you,
and you have the means to look into it,</b>

17:53.050 --> 17:54.220
<b>then you should look into it.</b>

17:54.920 --> 17:55.880
<b>Yeah.</b>

17:56.930 --> 17:58.470
<b>All right.</b>

17:58.470 --> 18:01.970
<b>JGDF TSUCHIURA STATION</b>

18:08.770 --> 18:10.940
<b><i>Who's calling at this hour?</i></b>

18:12.530 --> 18:15.320
<b><i>It's been a long time, Major Saeki.</i></b>

18:17.660 --> 18:20.200
<b>Ms. Yotsuba, long time no see.</b>

18:20.780 --> 18:26.710
<b><i>I'm sure you're quite busy,
so I'll keep this as brief as I can.</i></b>

18:27.540 --> 18:31.960
<b><i>Regarding the plot that your brigade
is about to fall victim to.</i></b>

18:33.050 --> 18:37.470
<b><i>During the Steeplechase Cross-country Event
at this year's Nine Schools Competition,</i></b>

18:37.470 --> 18:40.720
<b><i>an act of terrorism will be staged.</i></b>

18:41.850 --> 18:43.970
<b>Do you know who's behind it?</b>

18:44.270 --> 18:49.020
<b><i>A group led by Colonel Sakai
of the JDF General Headquarters...</i></b>

18:49.350 --> 18:55.530
<b><i>meaning that the masterminds behind this plot
are the so-called Anti-Great Asian Alliance hardliners.</i></b>

18:55.530 --> 19:00.740
<b><i>And your own brigade
has been assigned to actually pull it off.</i></b>

19:01.070 --> 19:04.450
<b>We have no intention
of playing such a farcical role.</b>

19:04.450 --> 19:06.410
<b><i>I don't believe you do, either.</i></b>

19:06.410 --> 19:09.370
<b>Then, what exactly are you trying to tell me?</b>

19:09.670 --> 19:13.380
<b><i>They're planning to involve
a member of my family, as well.</i></b>

19:14.210 --> 19:16.630
<b>You mean Special Officer Oguro?</b>

19:17.210 --> 19:19.720
<b><i>Very perceptive of you. I am impressed.</i></b>

19:19.720 --> 19:25.010
<b><i>Well, considering his nature,
it would be unavoidable.</i></b>

19:26.770 --> 19:33.400
<b><i>That said, we don't intend to play
the role we've been assigned, either.</i></b>

19:33.810 --> 19:36.280
<b>You want us to stop him?</b>

19:36.820 --> 19:41.110
<b><i>No. Since they're setting
the stage for us like this,</i></b>

19:41.110 --> 19:45.450
<b><i>I thought I'd have the hardliners...</i></b>

19:45.740 --> 19:47.080
<b><i>become the actual masterminds.</i></b>

19:47.540 --> 19:51.710
<b><i>Toward that end, I'd appreciate
your cooperation, Your Excellency.</i></b>

19:53.710 --> 19:55.960
<b>Are you telling me to send out troops?</b>

19:56.550 --> 19:58.670
<b><i>No, just to clean up afterward.</i></b>

19:58.670 --> 20:02.220
<b><i>After all, it wouldn't do for us
to emerge from behind the scenes.</i></b>

20:03.470 --> 20:06.220
<b>So, how will that benefit me?</b>

20:06.760 --> 20:11.230
<b><i>You will be able to blunt
the Ten Master Clans' interference toward the JDF.</i></b>

20:16.730 --> 20:18.280
<b>Fine, then.</b>

20:27.660 --> 20:30.160
<b>Are you sure about this, Madam?</b>

20:30.160 --> 20:31.120
<b>About what?</b>

20:31.410 --> 20:35.750
<b>Master Kudou's involvement
is still no more than speculation on our part.</b>

20:37.500 --> 20:41.090
<b>And I never brought his name up, did I?</b>

20:41.090 --> 20:42.090
<b>And besides...</b>

20:42.630 --> 20:47.600
<b>by the same token, it's not as if we have proof
of the hardliners' staged terrorist attack, either.</b>

20:47.930 --> 20:50.180
<b>So, it's a trumped-up charge.</b>

20:50.180 --> 20:53.520
<b>Well, but that, too, can't be helped.</b>

20:53.520 --> 20:57.610
<b>Since they're the ones
ordering the purge of the hardliners.</b>

20:58.190 --> 20:59.690
<b>I agree.</b>

20:59.690 --> 21:02.570
<b>We cannot go against our sponsors' wishes.</b>

21:02.570 --> 21:04.490
<b>Were it not for this development...</b>

21:04.490 --> 21:08.620
<b>we might have had to resort
to violent tactics ourselves.</b>

21:11.250 --> 21:17.040
<b>In that sense, this Gongjin Zhou fellow's
secret maneuvers are convenient for us.</b>

21:17.040 --> 21:21.880
<b>Though it does give me a headache
to think of how Master Tatsuya will respond.</b>

21:21.880 --> 21:25.340
<b>We don't want him to pull
another gaudy stunt like last year.</b>

21:25.680 --> 21:32.220
<b>I would hope that he'd sit tight
until at least New Year's next year.</b>

21:32.560 --> 21:39.480
<b>Still, if it ends up affecting Miyuki,
I can't very well tell him to hold back.</b>

21:40.020 --> 21:45.240
<b>Madam, do you believe
that Major Saeki will assist Master Tatsuya?</b>

21:45.820 --> 21:47.280
<b>It should be fine.</b>

21:47.280 --> 21:52.240
<b>Since she surely can't stop him,
her only option will be to help him.</b>

21:52.240 --> 21:57.210
<b>As if the JDF has the spine
to be so careless...</b>

21:57.830 --> 22:00.540
<b>with that most abominable magical weapon.</b>

22:07.720 --> 22:10.720
<b><i>After all, neither do I.</i></b>

23:36.350 --> 23:39.980
<b>THE IRREGULAR
AT MAGIC HIGH SCHOOL
STEEPLECHASE PART III</b>
